From tru64-unix-managers  Thu Sep 30 17:03:57 1999
From: "Miller, Anthony, A,  IT VF Ltd" <anthony.miller () vf ! vodafone ! co ! uk>
Date: Thu, 30 Sep 1999 17:03:57 +0000
