Hello,

I have ported KDE 1.1.2 to Digital/Tru64 Unix 4.0f. It has been verified
to run under 4.0e as well.

   Features: Sound (kmidi) with MME, Audio CD-ROM Player, Base and 
   Enhanced (C2) Security enabled.

   Lacks: No system information tools, User Administration not
   tested, kmix and sound output other than kmidi not working.

The distribution is available from:

        ftp://finwds01.tu-graz.ac.at/pub/kde/tru64_4.0x/dist

The complete development environment as well as a description how to
recompile everything is available from:

        ftp://finwds01.tu-graz.ac.at/pub/kde/tru64_4.0x/devel

Have fun // Tom

