Sorry for the delay in sending this summary. Hurricane Floyd
caused some anxious momements here and I am just now getting
around to sending this.

Thanks to all that replied. I got the answer in the first 10
minutes. I did not rebuild the kernel as I should have. 


>>> boot -fi genvmunix

Then do a sizer command. Make the changes to the <MACHINENAME>
file in /sys/conf. Do doconfig -c MACHINE and install the new
kernel.



