<DIV><SPAN class=329105420-17091999><FONT color=#0000ff face=Fixedsys 
size=2></FONT></SPAN><SPAN class=329105420-17091999><FONT color=#0000ff 
face=Fixedsys size=2>and then reattaching the removed plex for resyncing. 
Something along</FONT></SPAN></DIV>
<DIV><SPAN class=329105420-17091999><FONT color=#0000ff face=Fixedsys 
size=2></FONT></SPAN><SPAN class=329105420-17091999><FONT color=#0000ff 
face=Fixedsys size=2>the lines of:</FONT></SPAN></DIV>
<DIV><SPAN class=329105420-17091999><FONT color=#0000ff face=Fixedsys 
