<DIV><SPAN class=329105420-17091999><FONT color=#0000ff face=Fixedsys 
size=2></FONT></SPAN><SPAN class=329105420-17091999><FONT color=#0000ff 
face=Fixedsys size=2>&nbsp;&nbsp; ln -s /dev/vol/rootdg/backup 
