After receiving this mail I visited this site and in fact they offer
- ITI-6100U2/6101U2, Single port Ultra2/LVD SCSI PCI Host Adapter
- ITI-6200U2/6201U2, Dual port Ultra2/LVD SCSI PCI Host Adapter
Both adapters have native Driver support for TRU64 4.0F, for earlier
Version you need to install a given one.
Both adapters are recogniced by the firmware, genvmunix from
Version 4.0F can create the appropriate entries in your config-file.
You can boot your system from a drive attached to this adaper.
Both adapers are qualified for a range of Compaq Servers and
Workstations (also for other like SUN).

