I'm summarizing before my query hits the list, as I figured it out in the
meantime - hope this is of some use to someone, I asked query originally
because web search brought up nothing.

I used the osf/1 v2.0 configuration info:

vendor:         DEC
os:             OSF/1 (alpha)
os version:     2.0
compiler:       cc
cflags:         -g -DTW_TYPE32='int'
ldflags:        -non_shared
libs:           none
conf.h:         conf-osf1.h
notes:          Without the -g flag the compiler(actually "ugen") spins on 
md5.c
notes:          should use INSTALL= "/usr/bin/installbsd" or
notes:                     INSTALL= "/usr/bin/installbsd -c"
contributor:    Asokan <Asokan@UWaterloo.CA>

